      "message": "It looks like the way to do this would be to do it here: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/SwapChain.cpp;l\u003d132;drc\u003d04bbe3089844813b6c42f08575ace672c9a7202a;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1\n\nI think what you probably want would be:\n```\nauto texture \u003d mCurrentTextureInfo.texture;\nsurfaceTexture.texture \u003d ReturnToAPI(std::move(texture));\n```",
