      "message": "I saw that yesterday. What I was wondering is are textures returned from this function always guaranteed to be routed to an API entry point? At the moment that appears to be true, but I\u0027m not sure what the chances are that someone else tries to use this from an internal call in the future. Not clear on if there\u0027s a way to guard against that.",
